        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Accountable Care Organisation</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An accountable care organization (ACO) is a provider group that shares in savings if its patients&apos; spending beats a benchmark and quality targets are met.</skos:definition>
