        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Base Payment Rate</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Base rate is the standard payment per unit of case weight in prospective hospital payment, adjusted for local costs and multiplied by a stay&apos;s DRG weight.</skos:definition>
