        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">U-Shaped Hazard</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A bathtub hazard is a U-shaped hazard that is high soon after an event such as surgery, falls to a lower stable level, then rises again as patients age.</skos:definition>
