        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Begg and Mazumdar Test</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The Begg test is a rank correlation test (Kendall&apos;s tau) for small-study effects in a meta-analysis, a possible sign of publication bias.</skos:definition>
