        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Behavioural Change</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Behaviour change is a lasting shift in health-related actions such as smoking, diet or physical activity, pursued by policy to cut disease and its costs.</skos:definition>
