        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">BCR</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Benefit-cost ratio (BCR) is a health programme&apos;s monetised benefits divided by its costs, in present values, used to summarise a cost-benefit analysis.</skos:definition>
        <skos:hiddenLabel xml:lang="en">Cost-Benefit Ratio</skos:hiddenLabel>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Benefit-Cost Ratio</skos:prefLabel>
