        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Benefits Transfer</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Benefit transfer reuses willingness-to-pay values from earlier studies, such as the value of a statistical life, to value health benefits in a new setting.</skos:definition>
