        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Subsequent Entry Biologic</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A biosimilar is a biological medicine licensed as highly similar to an approved reference biologic, bringing price competition once its exclusivity ends.</skos:definition>
