        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Bootstrapped SE</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Bootstrap standard error is the standard deviation of an estimate, such as mean trial cost, recalculated across many resamples of the observed data.</skos:definition>
