        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Bronze Tier Plan</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A US Affordable Care Act marketplace plan category with a relatively low actuarial value, around sixty percent, giving lower premiums but higher cost-sharing.</skos:definition>
