        <owl:versionInfo>1.0.2</owl:versionInfo>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Cancer Screening is testing symptom-free people to find cancer or precancer early, judged economically on deaths prevented against cost and overdiagnosis.</skos:definition>
