        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Case Rate</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Per-Case Payment</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Case-Based Payment pays a hospital a fixed amount per treated case, set in advance for the case&apos;s group, often by diagnosis, not by the services used.</skos:definition>
