        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">CBC</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Choice-based conjoint (CBC) is conjoint analysis in which patients or others choose between sets of described treatments or services rather than rate them.</skos:definition>
