        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Choice Model Estimate</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Choice model estimate is a preference weight, or a derived value such as willingness to pay, from a choice model fitted to stated or revealed choices.</skos:definition>
