        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Cholesky Factorisation</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Cholesky decomposition factorises a positive-definite covariance matrix into a triangular matrix and its transpose, used to sample correlated PSA inputs.</skos:definition>
