        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Metabolic Disease Economics</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The application of health economic evaluation to long-lasting, non-communicable conditions such as diabetes and heart disease, typically using long time horizons.</skos:definition>
