        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">CDSS</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Clinical decision support (CDS) is software that matches a patient&apos;s data to clinical knowledge and gives clinicians tailored advice at the point of care.</skos:definition>
