        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Consensus Development</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Consensus building is the use of structured group methods, such as Delphi panels, to agree judgements for guidelines and policy when evidence is thin.</skos:definition>
