        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Cooling-Off Period</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A policy mechanism imposing a mandatory delay before a decision becomes final, meant to reduce impulsive choices made under pressure.</skos:definition>
