        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Core Outcome Set</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Core outcome set (COS) is the agreed minimum set of outcomes all trials in a condition should measure and report, so results can be compared and combined.</skos:definition>
