        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Cost Apportionment</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Cost allocation is the sharing of overhead and other indirect costs among health services or patients by a stated rule, such as bed-days or staff time.</skos:definition>
