        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Cure Rate</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Cured Proportion</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The cure fraction is the proportion of patients a survival model expects never to die from their disease, the level at which relative survival plateaus.</skos:definition>
