        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Digital Therapeutics</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A digital therapeutic (DTx) is health software that treats or alleviates a disease by delivering a medical intervention of proven therapeutic benefit.</skos:definition>
