        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Systemic Clearance</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A pharmacokinetic measure of the rate at which a drug is removed from the body, usually expressed as blood or plasma volume cleared per time.</skos:definition>
