        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Expanded Disability Status Scale</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Expanded Disability Status Scale (EDSS) is a clinician-rated 0 to 10 scale of multiple sclerosis disability, often used to set health states in MS models.</skos:definition>
