        <dcterms:identifier>HEO-L-3beaeb691bb5</dcterms:identifier>
        <linkRationale xml:lang="en">Full page kept; its weights are functions of the pooled Kaplan-Meier estimate; alternative to the unweighted log-rank.</linkRationale>
