        <dcterms:identifier>HEO-L-d7434b312add</dcterms:identifier>
        <linkRationale xml:lang="en">A funnel plot is a visual check for asymmetry, which may reflect publication bias or other small-study effects (Sterne et al. 2011); it does not quantify the bias</linkRationale>
