        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Gamma Survival Model</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A survival model assuming time-to-event data follow a gamma distribution, allowing hazard rates that increase, decrease, or stay constant over time.</skos:definition>
