        <owl:versionInfo>1.0.0</owl:versionInfo>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A health Gini coefficient is a scale-normalised measure of relative inequality in a specified nonnegative health variable across a population, obtained from pairwise differences or its Lorenz curve.</skos:definition>
