        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Individual Growth Model</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A growth curve model estimates how a repeatedly measured outcome changes over time, allowing the average trajectory and individual trajectories to differ under specified assumptions.</skos:definition>
