        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Strengthening Health Systems</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Efforts aimed at improving overall health system functioning, typically addressing core building blocks such as financing, workforce, or governance.</skos:definition>
