        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">System Perspective</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An analytic viewpoint including costs and outcomes across the healthcare system broadly, but still excluding costs falling entirely outside the health sector.</skos:definition>
