        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Research Ethics Board</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A formally constituted committee responsible for reviewing and approving human subjects research, ensuring risks are minimised and informed consent is adequate.</skos:definition>
