        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Intermediate Endpoint</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An outcome falling between an immediate biomarker response and a final, definitive outcome such as survival, often used as a surrogate.</skos:definition>
