        <owl:versionInfo>1.0.1</owl:versionInfo>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Interviewer bias is systematic error caused by how an interviewer asks questions or behaves, as in time trade-off or willingness-to-pay surveys.</skos:definition>
