        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Life Years Gained</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Life years gained (LYG) are the extra years of mean survival an intervention gives over its comparator, without quality adjustment, in economic evaluation.</skos:definition>
