        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Fisk Distribution</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A two-parameter continuous distribution for positive event times whose logarithm is logistic; its survival function has a heavy tail, and its hazard may rise and then fall.</skos:definition>
