        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Managed Access Program</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Managed Access Program is a PBS risk-sharing arrangement, set in a deed with the sponsor, giving access to a medicine while uncertainty is addressed.</skos:definition>
