        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Arithmetic Average</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A measure of central tendency obtained, in its arithmetic form, by dividing the sum of values by their count; a population mean is the corresponding expected value.</skos:definition>
