        <dcterms:source>Guyatt GH, Oxman AD, Vist GE, et al. GRADE: an emerging consensus on rating quality of evidence and strength of recommendations. BMJ. 2008;336:924-926. doi:10.1136/bmj.39489.470347.AD.</dcterms:source>
