        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Downhill Simplex Method</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A numerical optimisation algorithm searching for a function&apos;s minimum using a moving shape, called a simplex, without needing the function&apos;s derivative.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Nelder-Mead Method</skos:prefLabel>
