        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Orphan Drug Threshold</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The population size threshold defining a disease as rare or orphan for regulatory designation, varying somewhat across countries and jurisdictions.</skos:definition>
