        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Second-Order Uncertainty</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Parameter uncertainty is uncertainty in the estimated values of a health economic model&apos;s inputs, such as treatment effects, costs and utilities.</skos:definition>
