        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Statistical Distribution</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">In health economics, a mathematical function describing the probabilities of the possible values of an uncertain quantity, used to represent parameter and individual-level variation in economic models and probabilistic sensitivity analysis.</skos:definition>
