        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Protest Bid</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A response in a stated preference survey where a zero or non-informative valuation reflects objection to the survey scenario rather than genuine indifference.</skos:definition>
