        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Ratio Scale</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Ratio scale is a level of measurement with equal intervals and a true zero, such as cost or survival time, so a claim of twice the cost is meaningful.</skos:definition>
