        <dcterms:identifier>HEO-L-0c2b4cc222f1</dcterms:identifier>
        <linkRationale xml:lang="en">A recovery approach centres care on the person&apos;s own goals (both definitions); field placement is in the Knowledge Tree</linkRationale>
