        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Regulatory Authority</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A governmental body granted authority to create, implement, and enforce rules and standards within a specific domain, such as pharmaceutical safety.</skos:definition>
