        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Renal Dosing Alert</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A computerised notification warning a prescriber that a proposed dose may need adjustment given a patient&apos;s reduced kidney function.</skos:definition>
