        <linkRationale xml:lang="en">Placement: wiki topic Health financing and insurance in subdomain Health Systems; placed under Health Insurance, the concept named by its catalogue Level 3</linkRationale>
        <linkReviewStatus>unreviewed</linkReviewStatus>
