        <dcterms:identifier>HEO-L-1ebe0d43fde5</dcterms:identifier>
        <linkRationale xml:lang="en">Sequential analysis is the approach and the stopping rule is its prespecified criterion, so Sequential Analysis uses Stopping Rule.</linkRationale>
