        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Sobol Low-Discrepancy Sequence</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A method generating a sequence of points that fills a multidimensional space more evenly than simple random sampling, improving simulation efficiency.</skos:definition>
