        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Standardized Response Mean</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A responsiveness statistic calculated as the mean score change over time divided by the standard deviation of that change, unlike an effect size.</skos:definition>
