        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Statistical Method</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">In health economics, a formal procedure for analysing data to estimate effects, quantify uncertainty and test hypotheses, spanning parametric, non-parametric and semi-parametric approaches.</skos:definition>
