        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Equilibrium Distribution</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Stationary Distribution</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A steady state in a Markov model is the stationary distribution of a cohort across health states, unchanged from cycle to cycle under fixed transitions.</skos:definition>
