        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Time-to-Event Analysis</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Survival analysis examines the time from a defined origin to an event such as death, disease progression, hospitalisation, recovery or treatment discontinuation.</skos:definition>
