        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Technology Re-Evaluation</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A subsequent evaluation of a previously assessed technology, conducted to incorporate new evidence or reconsider a decision given changed circumstances.</skos:definition>
