        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Value of Information Analysis</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">VOI analysis (value of information analysis) takes a model&apos;s PSA through EVPI, EVPPI, EVSI and ENBS in turn to decide if more research is worth its cost.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">VOI Analysis</skos:prefLabel>
