        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">YLL</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Years of life lost (YLL) measure premature mortality as deaths times standard remaining life expectancy at the age of death, the fatal part of the DALY.</skos:definition>
